"displayed."
msgstr "警告ダイアログ表示時の警告音をON/OFF設定する"

msgid "Acknowledge time"
msgstr "通報時間"

msgid ""
"This is the time period in which an acknowledged airspace warning will not "
"be repeated."
msgstr ""
"通報時間\r\n"
"パイロットに通知を発する継続時間　繰り返しは無し"

msgid "Use black outline"
msgstr "黒い枠"

msgid ""
